{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773091520,"nonce":"oQqS50S/UwApqxYqpENC+Tf7N3c=","title":"graphview v2: remove branch nodes, add combobox filter, fix issue visibility","message":"Problems in initial GraphView implementation:\n\n1. Only branch nodes visible: branches use updated_at as created_at (always recent), so 50-node limit fills with branches before any issues/sessions appear\n2. Issues filtered by created_at with since=3d: long-running open issues never show\n3. Branch nodes should not exist — branches are a filter level, not a graph entity\n4. Two-level filter needed: repo combobox first, branch combobox second (disabled until repo selected)\n5. Navigation to Work tab broken (no branch param handling)\n6. Auth request deep-link (/?request=\u003cid\u003e) not handled by auth view\n\nRedesign:\n- Remove branch from GraphNodeType, remove auth_branch and branch_issue edge types\n- Open issues always included regardless of since filter (since only applies to sessions/auth_requests)\n- Add repo+branch combobox filter to graph view (autocomplete text input + datalist)\n- Send repo+branch params to server; server filters sessions by branch, auth_requests by head_branch\n- Add initialRequestId prop to auth view for deep-link navigation\n\nAlso: auth queue repo filter pills show old worktree names (feature__mandible-rename, Main, test, etc.) as if they were real repos — need to filter/normalize these.","files":null}]}